OL,3,GNEWSALoganair to axe Isle of Man-London
OL,4,ACity route
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights between the Isle of Man and
OL,7,FLondon City Airport will come to an end
OL,8,Fnext month.
OL,10,FLoganair will withdraw the route from
OL,11,F23 October following a review.
OL,13,FFrom 26 October, the airline will
OL,14,Fincrease its weekday London Heathrow
OL,15,Fservice to two return flights per day.
OL,17,FLoganair said the change was about
OL,18,Faligning its services "with customer
OL,19,Fdemand".
